      <title>AI教父VS教皇：这波“神仙打架”，到底谁更懂意识？</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/aivs-20260601211003806-1/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jun 2026 21:10:03 +0800</pubDate>
